rose. Every level in between gives you more or less detail, so you can race through a slow stretch and savour the part you love, all without ever leaving the page.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT\n\n• Finish more books — when a book isn't working, bail gracefully to a quick skim instead of adding it to the did-not-finish pile.\n• Variable detail slider (1–5) — read every section at the depth you want, from a one-line skim to the complete text.\n• One More Chapter — reached the end and not ready to let go? Generate a brand-new continuation in the tone you choose: exciting, silly, mundane, mind-bending, or a whole new genre.\n• Ask the book — curious about a character, a plot thread, or what a passage meant? Get instant answers right in the reader, carefully limited to what you've read so far. No spoilers, ever.\n• Tap to define — long-press any word to see its dictionary definition right in the page, without losing your place.\n• Bring your own books — import your EPUB and TXT files and read them your way.\n• A reader that stays out of your way — adjustable font size, light and dark themes, and reading progress that's always saved.\n• Bookmarks — mark the moments worth coming back to.\n\nYOUR LIBRARY, YOUR PRIVACY\n\nYour books and your account are yours. There are no ads and no trackers. You can delete your account — and the data tied to it — at any time, right from the app. Read our privacy policy at https://skimordive.com/privacy.\n\nWhether you're catching the gist on a busy commute or diving deep on a lazy Sunday, Skim or Dive lets you read at your own pace, at your own depth — and actually reach the end.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "minimumOsVersion": "15.1", "trackCensoredName": "Skim or Dive", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "45480960", "formattedPrice": "무료", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "12+", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/skim-or-dive/id6782638874?uo=4", "sellerUrl": "https://skimordive.c